[32m+[m[32m# Contributing to Task Tracker[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32mThanks for your interest in contributing! Here's how to get started.[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32m## 🔀 Workflow[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32m1. **Fork** the repository[m
[32m+[m[32m2. **Clone** your fork locally[m
[32m+[m[32m3. Create a **feature branch** from `main`:[m
[32m+[m[32m   ```bash[m
[32m+[m[32m   git checkout -b feature/your-feature-name[m
[32m+[m[32m   ```[m
[32m+[m[32m4. Make your changes and **commit** with clear messages:[m
[32m+[m[32m   ```bash[m
[32m+[m[32m   git add .[m
[32m+[m[32m   git commit -m "feat: add dark mode toggle"[m
[32m+[m[32m   ```[m
[32m+[m[32m5. **Push** your branch:[m
[32m+[m[32m   ```bash[m
[32m+[m[32m   git push origin feature/your-feature-name[m
[32m+[m[32m   ```[m
[32m+[m[32m6. Open a **Pull Request** against `main`[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32m## 📝 Commit Message Convention[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32mUse this format for commit messages:[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32m| Prefix   | Use for                     |[m
[32m+[m[32m|----------|-----------------------------|[m
[32m+[m[32m| `feat:`  | New features                |[m
[32m+[m[32m| `fix:`   | Bug fixes                   |[m
[32m+[m[32m| `docs:`  | Documentation changes       |[m
[32m+[m[32m| `style:` | Formatting, CSS changes     |[m
[32m+[m[32m| `refactor:` | Code restructuring       |[m
[32m+[m[32m| `test:`  | Adding or fixing tests      |[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32m**Examples:**[m
[32m+[m[32m```[m
[32m+[m[32mfeat: add task categories[m
[32m+[m[32mfix: prevent empty task submission[m
[32m+[m[32mdocs: update README with screenshots[m
[32m+[m[32mstyle: improve mobile layout[m
[32m+[m[32m```[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32m## 🐛 Reporting Bugs[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32mOpen an issue with:[m
[32m+[m[32m- Steps to reproduce[m
[32m+[m[32m- Expected vs actual behavior[m
[32m+[m[32m- Browser and OS info[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32m## 💡 Suggesting Features[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32mOpen an issue tagged `enhancement` with:[m
[32m+[m[32m- What problem it solves[m
[32m+[m[32m- How it should work[m
[32m+[m[32m- Any design mockups (optional)[m
