[32m+[m[32m## Exercise 9: Rebasing[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32m**Skills:** `git rebase`, interactive rebase[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32m```bash[m
[32m+[m[32m# 1. Create a branch with multiple small commits[m
[32m+[m[32mgit checkout -b feature/animations[m
[32m+[m
